 "«Amor a la sabiduría»: no es saberlo todo, sino <b>querer entender</b>. El filósofo no presume de saber; busca, duda y razona.": "\"Love of wisdom\": it isn't knowing everything, but <b>wanting to understand</b>. Philosophers don't boast of knowing; they search, doubt and reason.",
