 "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#ae7e23\">Falso dilema</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#1a2130\">Presentar solo dos opciones cuando hay más.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#ae7e23\">False dilemma</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#1a2130\">Offering only two options when there are more.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#2f6df0\">Pendiente resbaladiza</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#1a2130\">«Si permitimos esto, pasará lo peor».</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#2f6df0\">Slippery slope</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#1a2130\">\"If we allow this, the worst will happen.\"</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#2e9e6b\">Apelar a la mayoría</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#1a2130\">«Todo el mundo lo hace», luego está bien.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#2e9e6b\">Appeal to the majority</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#1a2130\">\"Everyone does it\", so it's fine.</span>",
 "Quiz. Ataca a la persona, no al argumento: ad hominem. Que lo justifiquen antes de revelar.": "Quiz. It attacks the person, not the argument: ad hominem. Have them justify it before revealing.",
 "«No le hagas caso sobre el clima: ni siquiera terminó el instituto». ¿Qué falacia es?": "\"Don't listen to him about the climate: he didn't even finish secondary school.\" Which fallacy is it?",
 "Falsa causa": "False cause",
