 "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#2e9e6b\">Carácter</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#231f1a\">¿Qué haría una persona honrada? Devolverla.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#2e9e6b\">Character</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#231f1a\">What would an honest person do? Return it.</span>",
